    "description": "NCEI Accession 0157266 includes Surface underway, chemical, optical and physical data collected from FRANKLIN in the Bismarck Sea, Coral Sea, North Pacific Ocean, Solomon Sea and South Pacific Ocean from 1990-10-02 to 1993-11-24. These data include FLUORESCENCE, Partial pressure (or fugacity) of carbon dioxide - water, SALINITY, SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURE and pH. The instruments used to collect these data include Carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer.\n\nThese data were collected by Bronte Tilbrook and Denis Mackey of Commonwealth Scientific and Industrial Research Organization as part of the VOS_Franklin_90_93 data set. CDIAC associated the following cruise ID(s) with this data set: 09FA19901002",
